# Xiao Furina Mavuika Xianyun. ~24s Rot. Xiao does 12 plunges with Mauvika & Furina vaporizing. VV Xiao + SoDP Xianyun >= LNO Xiao + VV Xianyun. Mauvika bursts every other rotation; Mavuika prefers Scroll to OC. 50% Collisions. 

